  "en": "Touya: How's it going?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 432,
  "text_len": 15
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:001CD",
  "jp": "セリカ「あ、うん、まあまあってとこかな‥‥」",
  "off": 461,
  "len": 27,
  "en": "Celica: Oh, um, not bad, I guess...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 463,
  "text_len": 24
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:001EB",
  "jp": "ヤマト「あれ？　ニャんか顔色悪くニャい？」",
  "off": 491,
  "len": 29,
  "en": "Yamato: Huh? Don't you look kinda pale, nyow?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 493,
  "text_len": 26
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:0020B",
  "jp": "セリカ「う、うん‥‥昨日はライブレードの{nl}　最終調整で徹夜だったから‥‥」",
  "off": 523,
  "len": 53,
  "en": "Celica: Y-yeah... I pulled an all-nighter on Rayblade's final tune-up yesterday...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 525,
  "text_len": 50
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:00243",
  "jp": "トウヤ「おいおい、大丈夫か？」",
  "off": 579,
  "len": 22,
  "en": "Touya: Hey, hey, you okay?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 581,
  "text_len": 19
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:0025C",
  "jp": "整備士F「あたしだったら自分の彼兵#8A2でもそこまで{nl}　できませんよ。まぁ、そのおかげでシステム関係を{nl}　残してほとんど調整は終わったんですからね。{nl}　ほんと、寝る間も惜しむとはチーフの為に{nl}　あるような言葉ですね」",
  "off": 604,
  "len": 128,
  "en": "Mechanic F: I couldn't go that far even for my own boyfriend. Well, thanks to her, the tune-up's almost done except for the system stuff. Honestly, \"sparing no time even for sleep\" is a phrase that might as well have been made for the chief.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 606,
  "text_len": 125
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:002DF",
  "jp": "セリカ「ち、ちょっと‥‥」",
  "off": 735,
  "len": 18,
  "en": "Celica: H-hey, come on...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 737,
  "text_len": 15
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:002F4",
  "jp": "トウヤ「そっか‥‥セリカ、ありがとうな」",
  "off": 756,
  "len": 25,
  "en": "Touya: I see... Celica, thanks.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 758,
  "text_len": 22
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:00310",
  "jp": "セリカ「え？　う、うん‥‥」",
  "off": 784,
  "len": 20,
  "en": "Celica: Huh? Y-yeah...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 786,
  "text_len": 17
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:00327",
  "jp": "トウヤ「でも、あまり無理はすんなよ。{nl}　お前に倒れられたら安心して任せられるやつが{nl}　いなくなるんだからな」",
  "off": 807,
  "len": 64,
  "en": "Touya: But don't push yourself too hard. If you collapse on us, there won't be anyone left I can trust with it.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 809,
  "text_len": 61
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:0036A",
  "jp": "セリカ「え？」",
  "off": 874,
  "len": 11,
  "en": "Celica: Huh?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 876,
  "text_len": 8
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:00378",
  "jp": "整備士F「それだけチーフを信頼してるってことですね。{nl}　その信頼がやがて燃え上がる恋に‥‥{nl}　ああ、なんかあこがれちゃうなぁ」",
  "off": 888,
  "len": 79,
  "en": "Mechanic F: That just shows how much he trusts you, chief. And that trust will someday blaze into love... Ahh, I'm kinda jealous.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 890,
  "text_len": 76
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:003CF",
  "jp": "セリカ「ちょっと⁉　な、なに言い出すのよ！」",
  "off": 975,
  "len": 29,
  "en": "Celica: Hey!? Wh-what are you going on about!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 977,
  "text_len": 26
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:003EF",
  "jp": "整備士F「あれ？{nl}　まんざらでもないって顔に書いてますよぉ」",
  "off": 1007,
  "len": 39,
  "en": "Mechanic F: Oh? It's written all over your face that you don't mind one bit~",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1009,
  "text_len": 36
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:00419",
  "jp": "セリカ「もぅ！　そんなんじゃないよ。{nl}　ねぇ、トウヤ‥‥？」",
  "off": 1049,
  "len": 37,
  "en": "Celica: Geez! It's not like that. Right, Touya...?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1051,
  "text_len": 34
 },
 {
  "id": "sce251:00441",
